{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208160","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320816001:1":{"text":"我们听到了呼救声，怎么回事？","source_cn":"我们听到了呼救声，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620194DD3444BBCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320816002:1":{"text":"呼救？一只闯进矿洞避风雪的野兽而已，我还犯不上为这点事呼救！","source_cn":"呼救？一只闯进矿洞避风雪的野兽而已，我还犯不上为这点事呼救！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BF581046089569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320816003:1":{"text":"说什么大话！刚才我们不来你就被咬断喉咙了！","source_cn":"说什么大话！刚才我们不来你就被咬断喉咙了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB1D6C8A0203504D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320816004:1":{"text":"没事！我应付得来！我的铁镐和榔头都很有力量！","source_cn":"没事！我应付得来！我的铁镐和榔头都很有力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7557C872A767828C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320816005:1":{"text":"无论发生什么，安全比什么都重要！突发情况的应对措施也在施工安全手册里！","source_cn":"无论发生什么，安全比什么都重要！突发情况的应对措施也在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5379C9C5D4D4D440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320816006:1":{"text":"知道了……但是也不能误工！我还有活儿要干，不能再耽搁了！","source_cn":"知道了……但是也不能误工！我还有活儿要干，不能再耽搁了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C1CCB01001CDDCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320816007:1":{"text":"呼……我的同胞们哪里都好，就是有时候太钻牛角尖了。","source_cn":"呼……我的同胞们哪里都好，就是有时候太钻牛角尖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x396A8360660EFDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320816008:1":{"text":"能意识到别人在钻牛角尖，是件好事！","source_cn":"能意识到别人在钻牛角尖，是件好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38E92BC1D64B81D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320816009:1":{"text":"嚯嚯嚯，谢谢你的夸奖！","source_cn":"嚯嚯嚯，谢谢你的夸奖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F566573237BB3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320816010:1":{"text":"安全起见，我得再回去提醒下其他同胞，洞内有野兽出没，他们得多注意施工安全，灵活应变！","source_cn":"安全起见，我得再回去提醒下其他同胞，洞内有野兽出没，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE924F7B899B3C9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:固执的矿工":{"t